{"ID":"20240205153839-7hqcdg4","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153839-7hqcdg4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153839-7hqcdg4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135306-zwamd9z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611173000-qb52hyw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240625150149-oyo6pxy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:12,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:12\u0026#125;","title":"196牡丹（牡丹皮、丹皮）","type":"doc","updated":"20240820155851"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206135306-zwamd9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135306-zwamd9z","updated":"20240206135315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产四川、安徽、河南、山东等地。\n【性状】\t呈筒状或半筒状，有纵剖开的缝，略向内卷曲或张开，长520cm，直径0.51.2cm，厚0.1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"0.4cm。原丹皮外表面灰褐色或黄褐色，有多数横长皮孔及细根痕，栓皮脱落处粉红色；刮丹皮粉红色或淡红色。内表面淡灰黄色或浅棕色，有明显的细纵纹，常见发亮的结晶 (系针、柱状牡丹酚结晶) 。质硬而脆，易折断。断面较平坦，淡粉红色，粉性，纹理不明显。气芳香，味微苦而涩，有麻舌感 。\n【性味】\t苦、辛，微寒。\n【功效】\t清热凉血；活血散瘀。温热病热入血分；发斑；吐衄；热病后期热伏阴分发热；阴虚骨蒸潮热；血滞经闭；痛经；痈肿疮毒；跌扑伤痛；风湿热痹。"}]},{"ID":"20240206135306-zn36w6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135306-zn36w6h","updated":"20240206135306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206135306-7voa20t.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155757-cmsszy6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155757-cmsszy6","updated":"20240205155757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡丹皮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡丹皮-20240205155757-l2m5u6i.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155757-1p0deij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155757-1p0deij","updated":"20240205155757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡丹皮2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡丹皮2-20240205155757-4awz1cc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240625145519-tsmvqol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240625145519-tsmvqol","updated":"20240820153912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 350px;","style":"width: 340px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡丹"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡丹-20240625145519-z2gbt70.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 340px;\" parent-style=\"width: 350px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 298px;","style":"width: 288px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡丹2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡丹2-20240625145558-nl07tb6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 288px;\" parent-style=\"width: 298px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 368px;","style":"width: 358px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"T